            "review_title": "Review at Wrap&roll Mplaza, D.1",
            "review_text": "wombatdavid\nHobart, Australia3231 contributions\n1\nDelicious Vietnamese food\nNov 2022\nThis restaurant is in a shopping centre near the Sofitel. We wanted a lighter dinner so had grilled chicken paper rolls and fried rolls. They were served with a fresh salad. On the expensive side for Vietnam but it was fresh and delicious. They do close at 8pm as the centre seems to close then.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten November 29, 2022",
